EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}So, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}you came over the
other day, and I couldn't talk to you
'cause I was sick.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}But thanks to the great {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicine{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} brought me,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I've made
a full recovery!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Du warst vor Kurzem bei mir,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
aber ich war zu krank, um mit dir
zu quatschen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}...
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Tja, {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} hat mir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Medizin{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
gebracht, deswegen bin ich wieder
gesund! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Was hast du für mich getan?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ee, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}geçen gün geldin
de hastaydım diye seninle konuşamamıştım.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ama {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ilaç{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} getiren {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} sayesinde{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tamamen iyileştim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿Me has perdonado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}El otro día viniste a verme y yo no
hacía más que quejarme de la salud.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Por suerte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} con reposo, infusiones
y tal, me he quedado como nuevo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Se acabaron las preocupaciones!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Estoy listo para comerme el mundo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
Geçen gün {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}soğuk algınlığına yakalandım,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ama {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} sırf iyilik olsun diye
gelip benimle ilgilendi.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Evet, {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} tamamen iyileşene
kadar her gün bana {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ilaç {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}getirdi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Söylemeye gerek yok,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}ama neredeyse
ağlayacak kadar duygulandım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
İşte,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dostluk böyle gösterilir, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Yahu, geçen gün öyle ağır soğuk
algınlığım vardı ki neredeyse ÖLÜYORDUM.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Yani, az kalsın.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Ama {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} günlerce bana {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ilaç {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}getirdi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
o olmasa şu an kesin yoktum.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}İşte BUNA{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}hayat kurtarmak derim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
